{"id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-site-sheaf-category.md","title":"Definition — Sheaf on a Site and Sheaf Category","display":"Definition — Sheaf on a Site and Sheaf Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","aliases":["14-df-site-sheaf-category"],"display":"Definition — Sheaf on a Site and Sheaf Category","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-small-site]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-site-sheaf-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-site-sheaf-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Sheaf on a Site and Sheaf Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75f5f3e37180e81\" href=\"?note=b75f5f3e37180e81\" title=\"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf\">14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为候选预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75f5f3e37180e81\" href=\"?note=b75f5f3e37180e81\" title=\"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf\">14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf</a> 定义的相容族集合。满子范畴见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\\\\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\ \\exists!s\\in F(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ (F(f)(s)=x_f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FullSubcat}\\bigl(\\widehat{\\mathcal C},\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\mid\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\\\\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\ \\exists!s\\in F(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ (F(f)(s)=x_f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FullSubcat}\\bigl(\\widehat{\\mathcal C},\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\mid\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.4 Sheaves on a Site，印刷页 121–127。相容性只对可复合的箭头量化，修复旧式使用未定域的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\circ g\">\\(f\\circ g\\)</span>。层范畴是预层范畴的满子范畴，故其箭头、恒等和复合均正式定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点（[[14-df-small-site]]）。$F$ 为候选预层；$\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)$ 是 [[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]] 定义的相容族集合。满子范畴见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点（[[14-df-small-site]]）。$F$ 为候选预层；$\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)$ 是 [[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]] 定义的相容族集合。满子范畴见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点（[[14-df-small-site]]）。$F$ 为候选预层；$\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)$ 是 [[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]] 定义的相容族集合。满子范畴见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\\\\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\ \\exists!s\\in F(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ (F(f)(s)=x_f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FullSubcat}\\bigl(\\widehat{\\mathcal C},\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\mid\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\circ g","display":false}],"bytes":1537,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category|Definition — Sheaf on a Site and Sheaf Category]]"},{"id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]"},{"id":"b5c7b94c4e3c3168","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 IX.5 式 (1)，印刷 487–488，DjVu 249–250，定义 locale 的覆盖及层，并指出此拓扑是典范拓扑。对象下闭集 $D_S$ 与箭头筛 $S=\\{(a,b):a\\in D_S\\}$ 逐一对应；本项保留箭头标签使它能直接传入[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]/[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]的站点签名。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]"},{"id":"5f75a3c8d7a1c91d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]"},{"id":"573e576a0d47c877","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"005f78978592c0bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category|Definition — Sheaf on a Site and Sheaf Category]]"},{"id":"68f3350ee8219486","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5d8dd49e5f3240a8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3c2e7637f8c4eeac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd293da57bc98716","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 满足 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]] 的 Giraud 条件；站点与层范畴见 [[14-df-small-site]]、[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]；小指 $\\mathcal U$-小。"},{"id":"e8b8317e69a22cc8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$ (sheaf category, see [[14-df-site-sheaf-category]])"},{"id":"93ae791420c1822a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8a95d86314c18fd6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0db90275ed4c618a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca489e8e614e025a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","5036bba7ca747e71","1601eff25